1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
You

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:39,400
There's no reason to be surprised. This was expected. It's only natural that I am the one still standing

3
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:46,080
And they're the ones who fell before me like insects. You're fools if you expected something else

4
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:54,640
Welcome to harsh reality, children. There are no surprises here. Also, there is no fear

5
00:00:54,640 --> 00:01:04,080
A sound soul dwells within a sound mind and a sound body

6
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:18,620
Kishin Asherah, I hope you're ready. Your soul is mine

7
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:25,060
You're a persistent one, aren't you? Returning to sanity after being devoured by the black blood

8
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:36,240
What's wrong? You're trembling. Are you afraid? Oh, yes. I think you're terrified

9
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:43,080
Everything wrong in this world is rooted in fear

10
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:54,900
Frustration, failure, betrayal, anger, tragedy, and of course, utter defeat

11
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:58,500
Stop talking. You don't have to hide it

12
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:00,540
Poor girl

13
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:02,020
Shut up!

14
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:06,440
Yelling won't get you anywhere. I'm not afraid of you

15
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:09,720
But you are very afraid of me indeed

16
00:02:09,720 --> 00:02:13,380
Thanks to that, I'll win this battle easily

17
00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:15,640
Say whatever you want

18
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:18,000
It won't change anything

19
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,820
She isn't shaking now

20
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:22,000
She's ready to face him

21
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,180
I am going to fight you

22
00:02:24,180 --> 00:02:25,840
And I'll win

23
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:28,400
Let's do this

24
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:32,000
Let's go, soul residents

25
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:48,560
The Kishin hasn't made a move yet

26
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:50,600
Find your cats and hit them hard

27
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:58,600
You're so weak

28
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:05,980
My final opponent and you're nothing more than a pathetic little girl

29
00:03:05,980 --> 00:03:07,440
What a shame

30
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:10,180
Maka, get up now

31
00:03:10,180 --> 00:03:13,880
Your little friends were so much stronger than you

32
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:15,580
And look how they ended up

33
00:03:15,580 --> 00:03:17,260
Move, Maka

34
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:26,640
You're getting up?

35
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:28,860
I think I prefer you on the ground

36
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:34,200
That position suits a little weakling like you

37
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:36,200
But I can kill you standing, too

38
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,820
Can you make it?

39
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:39,880
Of course I can

40
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:40,420
Let's go

41
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:43,660
If this lasts too long, I'll lose

42
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:46,060
I have to find an opening and strike

43
00:03:46,060 --> 00:03:47,320
As hard as I can

44
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,280
Only one thing will work

45
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,300
She's right

46
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:53,000
We can only use one technique

47
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,080
And that's

48
00:03:54,080 --> 00:04:01,520
Genie hunter

49
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,740
The anti-magic wavelength

50
00:04:03,740 --> 00:04:08,460
An incredibly powerful move handed down to her from her mother

51
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:11,440
The force that can erase evil

52
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:14,520
Removing impurities until only good remains

53
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:21,120
Here she comes

54
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:23,380
She's fighting the Kishin

55
00:04:23,380 --> 00:04:25,320
He's no ordinary opponent

56
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,940
He won't be beaten so easily

57
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:28,560
Dammit

58
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:31,480
My daughter's down there risking her life

59
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:33,360
And I can't do anything

60
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:35,560
Maka

61
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,180
Please

62
00:04:37,180 --> 00:04:39,520
Come back to me alive

63
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:49,820
Now is our chance

64
00:04:49,820 --> 00:04:52,640
This is it, Maka

65
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,860
Let's go

66
00:04:53,860 --> 00:05:03,600
Kishin hunter

67
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:15,360
A move that targets evil

68
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:18,500
But let me ask you one thing

69
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:21,140
Am I truly evil?

70
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:25,200
If you think I am, you're wrong

71
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:37,000
The madness within me that frightens you so much isn't evil

72
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,960
It's normal

73
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:43,560
Everybody in this world has a trace of insanity resting within them

74
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,840
Even you

75
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:46,800
Madness makes no exceptions

76
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:51,440
Screw you

77
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:53,440
What a foul mouth

78
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:55,700
I'll have to punish you for that

79
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:06,060
A sweet gesture

80
00:06:06,060 --> 00:06:07,640
But how futile

81
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:17,000
Sol

82
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,780
Are you okay?

83
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,640
Sol!

84
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,540
They all sacrificed themselves for you

85
00:06:25,540 --> 00:06:27,960
But in the end, is that truly a kindness?

86
00:06:29,340 --> 00:06:32,600
They've only moved the responsibility onto your shoulders

87
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:35,080
They've left you the fear of failure

88
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:37,280
Just shut the hell up

89
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:39,800
But that isn't all, is it?

90
00:06:40,300 --> 00:06:42,120
There's the fear of death, too

91
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:45,080
I thought I told you to shut the hell up!

92
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,420
The fear of loneliness

93
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:49,920
We can't forget that

94
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,800
And also

95
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:58,020
The fear of pain

96
00:06:58,020 --> 00:07:00,200
A primitive fear, all right

97
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:01,700
But a cruel one, nonetheless

98
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:03,560
Besides

99
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:07,220
It's effective enough against someone like you

100
00:07:07,220 --> 00:07:09,760
A weak little human

101
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:13,260
How can we be sure it's still going on?

102
00:07:14,060 --> 00:07:16,480
If something had happened to the Kishin, we'd know

103
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:19,640
The barrier he established would start to fade

104
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:21,480
For now we wait

105
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:24,920
And trust Maka to use her technique to destroy the Kishin

106
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,920
You're wrong

107
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:30,240
That's not what she needs

108
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:34,280
Maka's strength

109
00:07:34,280 --> 00:07:37,440
Doesn't come from some technique

110
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:41,260
Yes

111
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:43,480
You're right

112
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:46,280
I am a weak human

113
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:49,320
But this pain

114
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:53,080
I felt worse than this before

115
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:57,460
Much, much worse than this

116
00:07:57,460 --> 00:08:02,440
This pain is nothing!

117
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:06,040
Let's see how much pain you can handle then

118
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,240
You can dodge this

119
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:11,760
But if you do, your friend will die

120
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:25,980
That should finish it

121
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:34,260
Back up on your feet again, huh?

122
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,480
Well, that won't last long

123
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:42,080
What the?

124
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:49,840
Impossible

125
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:52,840
What magic is this?

126
00:08:53,980 --> 00:08:55,620
What did you do?

127
00:08:55,980 --> 00:09:03,580
I see, so that's what happened

128
00:09:03,580 --> 00:09:09,040
This girl is a weapon

129
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:12,240
No, it's something else

130
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:14,360
She's a meister, alright

131
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:16,020
But she also has weapon blood

132
00:09:16,020 --> 00:09:23,880
Why did the weapon within her not awake till now?

133
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:31,940
There's no trace of the fear she felt before

134
00:09:31,940 --> 00:09:34,420
Why not?

135
00:09:34,420 --> 00:09:46,020
Oh, now I see

136
00:09:46,020 --> 00:09:50,460
She's remaining unconscious so she won't feel fear

137
00:09:50,460 --> 00:09:54,020
She summons the weapons without knowing it

138
00:09:54,020 --> 00:09:58,980
Now that I understand, I can beat her

139
00:09:58,980 --> 00:10:01,620
This is a trick

140
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:03,080
I know how to fight

141
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:08,080
Come here, girl

142
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:17,120
Now I gotcha

143
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:22,660
Go on and stab me

144
00:10:22,660 --> 00:10:24,720
Go on and stab me, I'm not afraid of pain

145
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,140
Pain

146
00:10:25,140 --> 00:10:27,040
Not at all

147
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:29,760
But what about you?

148
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,520
Time to wake up

149
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:42,480
Fighting while your mind sleeps

150
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,980
That's not fair

151
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:47,860
There we go

152
00:10:47,860 --> 00:10:49,380
That's much better

153
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:53,760
That suffocating feeling you have now

154
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:55,500
That's fear

155
00:10:55,500 --> 00:10:59,480
You can let go now

156
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,020
That's enough

157
00:11:01,020 --> 00:11:03,380
Let the madness carry you away

158
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:05,920
And you'll be free from all fear and pain

159
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:09,920
Let go and everything you feel now will evaporate

160
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:12,760
There's nothing more you can do here

161
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:15,100
Your friends have fallen

162
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:16,640
Your big move failed

163
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:19,120
There's no point in continuing now

164
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:21,940
Everything you've done was for nothing

165
00:11:21,940 --> 00:11:25,500
You have no partner to stand beside you

166
00:11:25,500 --> 00:11:28,480
Your body is weak, bruised and beaten

167
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:32,940
There's nothing you can do now to defeat me

168
00:11:32,940 --> 00:11:35,120
You have nothing left

169
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:40,000
I have nothing left

170
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:43,820
Yes, that's right

171
00:11:43,820 --> 00:11:46,560
You have nothing, nothing at all

172
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:51,560
And I'll be alright then

173
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:58,560
I don't understand what you're saying

174
00:11:58,560 --> 00:12:03,380
Is there something else she can use besides the anti-magic wavelength?

175
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:04,980
Some other technique?

176
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:07,240
Like I said

177
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:10,180
Her greatest strength isn't a technique

178
00:12:10,180 --> 00:12:12,060
It's something different

179
00:12:12,060 --> 00:12:14,500
Something in here

180
00:12:14,500 --> 00:12:24,340
Krona is right about that

181
00:12:24,340 --> 00:12:27,480
Look who's awake

182
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:29,420
I'm back, baby

183
00:12:29,420 --> 00:12:32,680
I'm still as eloquent as ever, I see

184
00:12:32,680 --> 00:12:34,800
What?

185
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:35,300
What?

186
00:12:35,300 --> 00:12:36,020
What did you say?

187
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:42,260
Didn't you hear me?

188
00:12:42,340 --> 00:12:43,780
I said it's going to be alright

189
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:46,000
What?

190
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:46,800
No it won't

191
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:48,480
Alright!

192
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:51,100
The genie hunter isn't what I need to defeat you

193
00:12:51,100 --> 00:12:55,500
I went along with what the teacher said

194
00:12:55,500 --> 00:12:58,220
I thought that move was my only hope

195
00:12:58,220 --> 00:12:59,760
They were wrong

196
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:01,880
That isn't my greatest power

197
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:03,080
Not at all

198
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:05,520
What are you saying?

199
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,300
You little fool

200
00:13:08,300 --> 00:13:10,620
Maka isn't the fool, you jackass

201
00:13:10,620 --> 00:13:15,580
Do you all understand what I'm talking about now?

202
00:13:16,580 --> 00:13:17,940
Don't you get it yet?

203
00:13:18,420 --> 00:13:20,740
Maka may not be a great star like I am

204
00:13:20,740 --> 00:13:23,000
But she's got something amazing, alright

205
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,800
Maka's strength

206
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:27,280
Isn't some special ability

207
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:29,280
It's more

208
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:31,340
It's something

209
00:13:31,340 --> 00:13:33,120
That can beat fear

210
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,660
It's bravery

211
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:37,500
That's all bravery?

212
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:40,820
I don't understand you people

213
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:45,300
You put faith in something as fragile as one girl's bravery?

214
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:50,920
Stop it

215
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:52,360
Don't look at me like that

216
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:55,500
How can you be so calm at a time like this?

217
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,000
What's happening?

218
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,800
Who the hell are you?

219
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:03,400
I'm academy student Maka Alban

220
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:05,000
One star scythemeister

221
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,940
Not what I meant

222
00:14:06,940 --> 00:14:09,180
I'm not asking you your name

223
00:14:09,180 --> 00:14:11,080
You're standing there so calmly

224
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,520
That's not normal

225
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,360
What are you?

226
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:15,780
I'm just me

227
00:14:15,780 --> 00:14:17,980
Nothing more and nothing less

228
00:14:17,980 --> 00:14:20,720
She's making me nervous

229
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:23,400
But I don't understand why that is

230
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:24,540
I'm so confused

231
00:14:24,540 --> 00:14:26,760
It's like the feeling you get

232
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,340
When you wake up from a bad dream

233
00:14:28,340 --> 00:14:29,320
You can't remember

234
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,780
I've had enough of this

235
00:14:31,780 --> 00:14:34,360
You have to die now

236
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:36,020
I'm going to kill all of you

237
00:14:36,020 --> 00:14:39,220
I don't have any other time

238
00:14:39,220 --> 00:14:42,540
Shujat

239
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:44,040
What?

240
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,100
What is that?

241
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:48,360
A postcard

242
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,800
With a message

243
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:52,520
But that doesn't matter

244
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:54,920
It's none of your business

245
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:56,700
None of my business?

246
00:14:56,700 --> 00:14:59,620
How could you talk to me like that?

247
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,120
You insolent

248
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:03,080
Oh no

249
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:04,580
Whatever you're doing

250
00:15:04,580 --> 00:15:05,300
Stop!

251
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:06,240
No

252
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,500
I won't

253
00:15:07,500 --> 00:15:11,040
I've come too far to stop now

254
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:13,040
If I gave up

255
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:13,060
If I gave up

256
00:15:13,060 --> 00:15:14,800
How could I face the people

257
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:15,800
Who have stood by me

258
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:18,000
Supported me for so long

259
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,040
They're the reason I'm here

260
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:22,240
They lent me their courage

261
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:27,680
Now it's time to use my own

262
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:30,700
It's time for me to be brave for them

263
00:15:30,700 --> 00:15:32,820
That's ridiculous

264
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:36,200
You don't know what you're talking about

265
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:38,900
Bravery is my armor

266
00:15:38,900 --> 00:15:40,960
And this is my weapon

267
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:44,200
Fool

268
00:15:44,200 --> 00:15:48,360
You really think that pitiful little fist will hurt me?

269
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,060
You'll accomplish nothing

270
00:15:50,060 --> 00:15:52,700
Why can't you see how useless it is to try?

271
00:15:52,940 --> 00:15:55,340
You should have given this fight up a long time ago

272
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:59,280
I don't understand anything that's going on

273
00:15:59,280 --> 00:16:13,040
I don't get it

274
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:24,120
Why do you have so much faith in her?

275
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:27,240
She's weak

276
00:16:27,240 --> 00:16:30,860
She isn't special

277
00:16:30,860 --> 00:16:35,580
She's nothing more than a human

278
00:16:35,580 --> 00:16:40,400
What is bravery?

279
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:55,420
Kishin, are you ready?

280
00:16:55,820 --> 00:16:56,660
I'm coming!

281
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,200
Go away!

282
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:09,280
What's the point of destroying me?

283
00:17:10,540 --> 00:17:13,400
Madness won't disappear just because I'm gone

284
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:16,620
Another one will take my place

285
00:17:16,620 --> 00:17:18,240
There will be a new Kishin

286
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,740
An heir to my madness

287
00:17:19,740 --> 00:17:23,400
He will rain insanity upon the worlds of the Niacan

288
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:27,020
That's the way this world will always be

289
00:17:27,020 --> 00:17:29,140
Why can't you see your struggle is pointless?

290
